Have your feet been trying to take you somewhere lately? Or trying to tell you something. Have a good chat with them we are sure they will say we need African dancing. Dancing starts back this week folks!  All beginners and experienced dancers welcome. Don't forget we have live drumming! Its impossible to not get your groove on! See you at Palmwoods Memorial Hall 7-8pm Tuesdays! For more info [contact us](/contact-us/).
